        "id": "setting-it-up",
        "text": "Staged patching needs approved actions to be set up already: the approval signer, its roster, and in the signed repository. Patching setup is the production order, with a live pre flight. On top of that: 1. Build and publish the 0.27 signed agent ( ) through the offline signed update chain. Agents report in their heartbeat once they run it. 2. Give the computers time to scan, or press Scan now on a computer's Patches tab. 3. Choose a canary that's representative, is offered the updates, and that someone can restart. There are no new server settings."
